# noinput: the same probes as perf-sustain with every touch removed, for the comparison round that
# asks whether the slow draws depend on the 125 Hz touch injection.
#
# perf-sustain's three 32 s drag segments are replaced by one `wait 200`, which keeps the round the same
# length and leaves the screen untouched. The probe lines are copied unchanged: an input-free round that
# also changed the probes would not be comparable with the rounds it is compared against.
#
# init waits for each line, so every background line ends with & and goes before rwtouch.
/redwood/bin/lsprobe 60 &
/redwood/bin/lsprobe 300 &
/redwood/bin/framewatch --every 20 --count 30 SpringBoard backboardd &
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 200